Are you passionate about web development, digital products, and the space sector? Would you like to expand your technical expertise while contributing to an innovative and rapidly evolving industry?  &nbsp;  


Joining Novaspace means becoming part of a fast-growing international consulting group specializing in the space sector. Novaspace is currently hiring a Web Engineer to support the development and continuous improvement of its digital platforms, websites, and web-based products.  &nbsp;  


 As part of the Digital and Data team, the Web Engineer will contribute to Novaspace’s digital activities by developing and maintaining WordPress and WooCommerce websites, custom PHP solutions, React interfaces, and API integrations.  &nbsp;   

 Responsibilities    


Develop, customize, and maintain WordPress and WooCommerce websites  
Build custom PHP features, themes, plugins, and backend functionality  
Develop responsive and user-friendly interfaces using React, HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript  
Integrate third-party services, payment solutions, and internal systems through APIs  
Monitor, troubleshoot, and improve website performance, security, reliability,

